FR-LV-02	Leave Balance	View paid, carried, encashed leave balance
FR-LV-03	Admin Approval	Admins approve/reject leave requests
FR-LV-04	Leave Category Override	Admins override category to "Privilege"
FR-LV-05	Leave Encashment	Request encashment of carried leave
FR-LV-06	Leave Notifications	Email notifications to configured recipients
FR-LV-07	Leave Calendar	Calendar view of leave requests
FR-LV-08	Monthly Leave Report	Monthly leave usage summary
5.4 Daily Report Module
ID	Function	Description
FR-DR-01	Submit Report	Employees submit daily reports
FR-DR-02	Department Templates	B2B/B2C: Activity hierarchy with quantity/duration; HR/IT: Plain description
FR-DR-03	Report Status	Track submitted/draft status
FR-DR-04	View Reports	Employees view personal reports; Admins view team reports
FR-DR-05	Admin Reports	Admins view all employee reports with filtering
