5.7 Office IP Management Module
ID	Function	Description
FR-IP-01	Add IP	Admin adds approved office IP
FR-IP-02	Toggle IP	Admin activates/deactivates IP
FR-IP-03	Delete IP	Admin removes IP
FR-IP-04	List IPs	Admin views all configured IPs
5.8 Holiday Management Module
ID	Function	Description
FR-HOL-01	Add Holiday	Admin adds holiday (date + name)
FR-HOL-02	List Holidays	Admin views all holidays
FR-HOL-03	Delete Holiday	Admin removes holiday
